 "gaps": [
  {
   "text": "The FCOM trigger names only both ACSCs failed, but the procedure also has the branch \"If FAULT was due to an overheat\". The manuals do not state that this alert follows an AIR L(R) WING LEAK with an AIR PACK 1(2) OVHT. Confirmed by the user: show it as the third step of that sequence.",
   "applies_to": [
    "all"
   ],
   "refs": [
