     "book": "FCOM",
     "code": "PRO-ABN-AIR",
     "page": "P 76/82",
     "pdf": 2965
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The FCOM note on closing the FWD CARGO ISOL VALVE is left out of the flow: the If Installed table lists the FWD ISOL Valve as not installed, and likewise FWD Cargo Heating, although STATUS prints FWD CRG HEAT.",
   "applies_to": [
    "all"
   ],
   "refs": [
