     "page": "P 26/78",
     "pdf": 119
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The FCTM has no chapter for this alert and no PDP module covers it. Confirmed by the user: the PF flies the descent and the ECAM continues, with no STOP ECAM before STATUS.",
   "applies_to": [
